=== 3. the proved radius, and the measured one ===
   the condition is 4r*g1(1+2r) < Gamma(A); for the odd numbers g1(x) = 2/(2-x)^2 exactly
   max | g1 - 2/(2-x)^2 | over k = 20,40,80 and x = 1.0..1.3 : 8.71e-03   (finite-k truncation)

